==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Frozen Hearty Salmon are made by exposing [[Hearty Salmon]]s to [[Ice]]. They restore four of [[Link]]'s [[Heart]]s and grant him temporary [[Heat Resistance]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> Due to the removal of the excess fat, these Salmon do not taste as fishy as they used to.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/>

==={{TotK|-}}===
Frozen Hearty Salmon return in {{TotK}} s a variety of [[Frozen Food]]. They can be made by exposing [[Hearty Salmon]]s to a [[Freezing Climate]] or [[Cold Water]]. As a result of being frozen, excess fat has been removed, which results in a decrease to their [[Fish]]-like taste.<ref name="TotK Inventory"/> By eating a Frozen Hearty Salmon, [[Link]] can heal four [[Heart]]s and receive one level of temporary [[Heat Resistance]].

